---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Practice">
  
  <div class="min-h-screen pt-40 pb-20 px-6 flex flex-col items-center">
    
    <!-- 1. THE IDENTIFIER -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-2xl mb-12 flex justify-between font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50 border-b border-system-black pb-2">
      <span>00.01</span>
      <span>Biography</span>
      <span>ZA</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. THE NARRATIVE (Editorial Layout) -->
    <article class="w-full max-w-2xl font-sans text-xl md:text-2xl leading-[1.4] tracking-tight space-y-12">
      
      <p>
        <span class="font-bold">Thapelo Madiba Masebe</span> is a transdisciplinary practitioner operating at the intersection of data, memory, and emerging African identity.
      </p>

      <p>
        His practice charts an emotional geography that stretches from his origins in <span class="text-accent-blue">Seshego, Limpopo</span> (representing ancestral memory) to his current studio in <span class="text-accent-blue">Johannesburg</span> (representing the urban intersection).
      </p>

      <p>
        He works from a professional office, not a traditional studio. This operational model prioritizes systems over chaos, merging the rigor of Data Science with the intuition of Fine Art. He calls this duality the <span class="italic text-accent-red">Systematic-Poetic</span>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Currently, he is formalizing his technical stack through a Data Science Learnership while architecting <strong>Studio Masebe</strong>, a decentralized cultural institution for the 21st century.
      </p>

    </article>

    <!-- 3. THE SKILLS MATRIX (The "Data" Layer) -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-2xl mt-32">
      <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50 mb-8 border-b border-system-black pb-2">
        00.02 // Capabilities
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-y-8 gap-x-4">
        <!-- Column 1 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-accent-blue">LOGIC</span>
          <ul class="font-sans text-sm space-y-1">
            <li>Python (Pandas/NumPy)</li>
            <li>SQL / Database Arch</li>
            <li>Machine Learning</li>
            <li>GraphRAG</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Column 2 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-accent-red">SENSATION</span>
          <ul class="font-sans text-sm space-y-1">
            <li>Art Direction</li>
            <li>Photography</li>
            <li>Generative Art</li>
            <li>Sound Design</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Column 3 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-system-black/50">SYSTEMS</span>
          <ul class="font-sans text-sm space-y-1">
            <li>Linux / Bash</li>
            <li>Git / Version Control</li>
            <li>Docker</li>
            <li>Astro / React</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

         <!-- Column 4 -->
         <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-system-black/50">OFFICE</span>
          <ul class="font-sans text-sm space-y-1">
            <li>Project Management</li>
            <li>Creative Strategy</li>
            <li>Technical Writing</li>
            <li>Brand Architecture</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</MainLayout>
